      "writtenOn": "2026-06-25T13:22:02Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "5. run_mode is documented but completely unimplemented\n\n  DayzeroPlugin and CloudCmdPlugin declare run_mode \u003d \"per_cloud\", the README describes per_host vs per_cloud behavior, and there\u0027s a test that the\n  attribute can be set - but DayzeroDispatcher.execute() ignores it entirely and always calls plugin.execute(cloud). The per_host behavior described in\n  the docs (calling execute once per host with a single hostname string) is never implemented. This is a non-functional documented API.",
      "revId": "3bd7e03700c722c478d67be5bfefd47a70cf2d99",
      "serverId": "d5d70762-12d0-45a1-890d-524b12d3f735"
