      "side": 1,
      "message": "According to claude, and someone else can confirm:\n\n Issues Found\n\n  Critical\n\n  1. Missing await on dayzero_dispatcher.execute() in notify.py:227-228\n\n  dayzero_dispatcher \u003d get_dayzero_dispatcher()\n  dayzero_dispatcher.execute(ass.cloud.name)   # \u003c-- coroutine is never awaited\n\n  DayzeroDispatcher.execute() is async. Calling it without await silently creates and immediately discards a coroutine object. The dayzero plugins will\n  never execute. This is the most impactful bug in the PR.",
